Package: legion-control
Version: 0.8.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Legion Control contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/ulrickpsp/legion-control-linux
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/ulrickpsp/legion-control-linux.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/ulrickpsp/legion-control-linux
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, python3-cairo, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), gir1.2-adw-1, pkexec, polkitd, systemd
Description: native Lenovo Legion controls for Linux
 Legion Control provides a GTK interface for thermal profiles, fan curves,
 custom CPU power, 24-zone keyboard RGB, quick scenes, short telemetry
 history, battery conservation, Fn Lock, and camera power on explicitly
 supported Lenovo Legion laptops.
